---
description: TILA Angular structure and UI rules
globs: Web/src/**/*.ts,Web/src/**/*.html,Web/src/**/*.scss
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/architecture/frontend-architecture.md` and `docs/architecture/design.md` before UI or feature work. Read `Web/AGENTS.md`.

- Standalone components only.
- HTTP via `core/services/api.service.ts` and feature `*-feature.service.ts` — no raw `HttpClient`/`fetch` in components.
- Models in `core/models`. Use `takeUntilDestroyed` for subscriptions.
- Follow landing + navbar patterns; most feature folders are placeholders.
- Prefer shared Tailwind tokens from `docs/architecture/design.md`; avoid one-off hex and arbitrary font sizes.
- Dev API base is `/api/v1` with `proxy.conf.json`.
